#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0691 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
#note "Group (DEV01,001,GLUC): no ABLFL=Y -> FIRES row 1. Group (DEV02,001,GLUC) has its own baseline -> no fire. Same subject+parameter across two devices is the PER-DEVICE grouping discriminator vs AD0127. class=MD-BDS is the declared structure (Fix #179 set: [MDBDS, BDS]); the mandatory #library line is the declaration carrier. GROUP sensitivity, one finding, anchored row 1."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 SPDEVID=DEV01
dataset ADLBC class=MD-BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SPDEVID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col BASE    type=Num
col BASEC   type=Char
col ABLFL   type=Char
---
S1 | 001 | DEV01 | GLUC | 5.2 | 5.1 | | N
S1 | 001 | DEV02 | GLUC | 5.4 | 5.1 | | Y
